<title>ARGENTINA: BAESA posts 1st half 48.5 mln peso loss.</title>
<headline>BAESA posts 1st half 48.5 mln peso loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31</p>
<p>Net loss 48.5 million pesos vs N/A</p>
<p>Note: Net loss at Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA, the Pepsi bottler, included an unspecified extraordinary loss of 16.6 million pesos in the first half. Net assets were negative, at 18.7 million pesos. Q2 results or other information were not provided.</p>
<p>((-Gary Regenstreif, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618))</p>
